/**
 * @file LumexJson
 * @brief JSON module: non-throwing helpers for JSON configuration files, and
 * validation and normalization of a document against a JSON Schema draft-7
 * subset.
 * @details Link `lumex::json` (header-only). The module is written against
 * nlohmann/json 3.x and does not ship it: put your own `<nlohmann/json.hpp>` on
